{{!-- The party sheet's top, on the actor header's skeleton so it lines up with the other two at
      the same window width: portrait, then the one name field. Nothing else — a party has no
      statistics, so there is no sub-line of numbers to carry and no chips to offer. The frame
      around the name is drawn at runtime by `module/ink.js`; the portrait has none, as on the
      character's and the NPC's. --}}
<div class="cairn-sheet-header cairn-actor-header">

    <div class="cairn-header-row">
        <div class="cairn-portrait-frame">
            <img class="portrait" src="{{actor.img}}" data-action="editImage" data-edit="img" />
        </div>

        <div class="cairn-header-main">
            <div class="cairn-header-line">
                <input class="name-input" type="text" name="name" value="{{actor.name}}"
                    placeholder="{{localize 'CAIRN.Name'}}"
                    data-ink="box" data-ink-seed="actor-name" data-ink-w="1.6" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
